    <string name="sync_first_body">The file has %1$s items from: %2$s.\nThis device\'s data will be merged with it. Nothing is replaced wholesale: for each item the newest edit wins, and deletions carry over. It\'s a good idea to make a backup first.</string>
    <string name="sync_first_title">Merge with this file?</string>
    <string name="sync_how_body">1. Device A: tap «Create sync file» and save masarifi-sync.json in Google Drive.\n2. In the Google Drive app, share that file (or its folder) with device B\'s Google account as Editor.\n3. Device B: tap «Open existing sync file» and pick that SAME file in Google Drive.\n4. Tap «Sync now» on each device, or turn on auto-sync. Each sync merges both sides: the newest edit of each item wins and deletions reach the other device.</string>
